# From new_game_save's save file: continue file 1, take the gun from the coat too, and save again.

# The logos, then the title, which Start ends.
.:900 T:4 .:300
# File 1 is good, so A opens its menu, and A on CONTINUE loads it.
A:4 .:120 A:4 .:300

# Choose TAKE: from EXAM, down, right, A.
D:3 .:20 R:3 .:20 A:3 .:30
# Up twice leaves the commands for the picture. Up and right, to where the coat was.
U:3 .:20 U:3 .:20 .:30 U:30 R:12 .:10
# Click it, and press A through the messages.
A:3 .:240 A:3 .:300 A:3 .:300 A:3 .:120

# Down out of the picture lands on OPEN. Right, right, down, down is SAVE.
D:42 .:20 R:3 .:20 R:3 .:20 D:3 .:20 D:3 .:20
# Click SAVE, and A on the dialog's YES.
A:3 .:200 A:3 .:300
